    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A glimpse into the daily life of a Fugu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A Fugu's Dive&quot; is a 2D physics-based action game where you use mouse controls to make a Fugu jump and climb higher. Skillfully jump from one body of water to another without falling, and aim for the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the left mouse button and pull back to charge up power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Release the button to launch the Fugu in the opposite direction with the stored power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can cancel the charge by right-clicking while holding down the left mouse button.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the Fugu is in the air, it cannot be controlled.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the Esc key to open the pause menu.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A glimpse into the daily life of a Fugu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A Fugu's Dive&quot; is a 2D physics-based action game where you use mouse controls to make a Fugu jump and climb higher. Skillfully jump from one body of water to another without falling, and aim for the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the left mouse button and pull back to charge up power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Release the button to launch the Fugu in the opposite direction with the stored power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can cancel the charge by right-clicking while holding down the left mouse button.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the Fugu is in the air, it cannot be controlled.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the Esc key to open the pause menu.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
